# Fae Flight: "Enchant creature. When this Aura enters, enchanted creature gains hexproof until end of turn. Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 and has flying."
# Bot1 enchants its Memnite on turn 3: it is a 2/1 with flying and hexproof, so Bot2's Bolt (Mox Ruby's red open) cannot target it (CR 702.11b), while the same
# Bolt may target the Ornithopter, the positive control, which dies. A Mox is not a creature, so it is refused as the Aura's target. On Bot2's turn 4 the hexproof has
# ended: the second Bolt targets the enchanted Memnite, which dies, and the Aura goes with it.

